Third-party components (not included in this repository; they keep their own licences)

- SKYRIS Technic software image (ROS packages technic, aruco_pose, yolo_face and
  their configuration). drone/fire_detector_node.py was written by the team; its
  environment set-up lines (site paths, LD_LIBRARY_PATH, ROS logging workaround)
  follow the SKYRIS yolo_face RKNN node. The licence of the SKYRIS software was
  not available to the team, so the redistribution terms of that portion have not
  been checked.
- ROS Noetic, rosbridge, web_video_server, cv_bridge, tf2 (BSD-3-Clause)
- OpenCV (Apache-2.0), NumPy (BSD-3-Clause), Pillow (MIT-CMU)
- Rockchip RKNN-Toolkit2 / RKNN-Toolkit-Lite2 and librknnrt (Rockchip licence)
- Ultralytics YOLOv8 (AGPL-3.0): used on the laptop for training and export only;
  no Ultralytics code is part of this repository or runs on the drone. The trained
  model weights are not included.
- PX4 Autopilot (BSD-3-Clause), MAVROS (BSD-3-Clause)
- openpyxl (MIT): only for tools/build_module_c_workbook.py
